   "text": "INTO University of Exeter - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nINTO University of Exeter\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nThe University of Exeter has an international reputation for outstanding teaching, research and graduate employability prospects. Students can progress to more than 150 degrees from our flexible pathways and kick-start their career at a prestigious Russell Group institution. Top 150 university in the world (QS World University Rankings 2022).84% of INTO University of Exeter students achieve a 1st or 2:1 in their degree (based on INTO Exeter undergraduate progressors who graduated in 2021).Top 5 safest cities in England and Wales (The Complete University Guide ‘How Safe is Your City?’ 2022).Progression to 150+ degrees at the University of Exeter, including 16 subjects in the QS World Top 100 (QS World University Rankings by Subject 2021).97% overall student satisfaction; 96% of students feel prepared for their university studies (INTO Annual Student Experience Survey 2022).\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 09:58\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 09:58\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £21,950.00\nMin: £20,195.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n21%\n4,958 of 23,613 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nINTO\nFounded Year\n1855\nCampus(es)\nExeter\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n17/01/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAs accommodation is allocated on a first-come, first-served basis, students should confirm their place soon after receiving an offer to have the best chance of getting their preferred option.\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bTMOULhpGQM\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
